  "question_stem": "A particle moves in a straight line. It starts from rest, at time $t = 0$, and accelerates at $0.6t \\text{ m s}^{-2}$ for $4 \\text{ s}$, reaching a speed of $V \\text{ m s}^{-1}$. The particle then travels at $V \\text{ m s}^{-1}$ for $11 \\text{ s}$, and finally slows down, with constant deceleration, stopping after a further $5 \\text{ s}$.",
